  "releaseNotes": "Bastion Krypton Suite 1.0.0. A drop-in redistribution of the Krypton Standard Toolkit (upstream baseline 105.x). Original controls (c) Component Factory Pty Ltd (2006-2016) and the Krypton Suite team (2017-). Assembly and NuGet package IDs are prefixed 'Bastion.' to avoid collisions with the upstream Krypton.* assemblies; namespaces and public types are unchanged, so existing 'using Krypton.*;' code compiles without modification.",
